E r.board_seat AND r.tier >= $minTier AND c.size_usd >= $minSize\nRETURN b, r, c\nORDER BY c.size_usd DESC\nLIMIT 25","isUpdateQuery":false,"isWriteTransactionChecked":false,"params":[{"name":"$minTier","dataType":"Integer","suggestions":"none","cypher":null,"suggestionLabel":null,"suggestionProp":null,"suggestionBoolean":false,"collapsed":false},{"name":"$minSize","dataType":"Float","suggestions":"none","cypher":null,"suggestionLabel":null,"suggestionProp":null,"suggestionBoolean":false,"collapsed":false}],"hasCypherErrors":false},{"name":"T2. Control running through an intermediate holding company - a variable-depth traversal to a data-determined depth. SAME_ENTITY_AS is in the pattern because a holding company that is both controlled and controlling exists as two nodes (a Company and a BeneficialOwner) sharing one CIK, and a variable-length pattern cannot jump on property equality. LIMIT: CONTROLS means a verified >=50% 13D stake and 13D carries no exit obligation below 5%, so roughly half these edges predate 2020 and are last-known, not current. Read filing_date on the edge.","id":"tmpl:1785968038953","createdAt":1785968038953,"text":"Transitive control chain","cypher":"MATCH p = (root:BeneficialOwner)-[:CONTROLS]->(:Company)\n          -[:SAME_ENTITY_AS]->(:BeneficialOwner)-[:CONTROLS]->(:Company)\nRETURN p\nLIMIT 25","isUpdateQuery":false,"isWriteTransactionChecked":false,"params":[],"hasCypherErrors":false},{"name":"T3. The connected component of filers who co-target the same issuers; size and diameter are emergent. Default: ICAHN CARL C. The coalesce() is load-bearing - without it this returns ZERO paths instead of 1,928, because is_custodial is absent on all but 13 of 17,235 filers and NONE(... WHERE null) evaluates to null, not true. Custodians and index hubs are labelled, not deleted, so the co-filing fact survives and the exclusion stays auditable.","id":"tmpl:1785968038954","createdAt":1785968038954,"text":"Activist coalition around $filerName","cypher":"MATCH p = (seed:BeneficialOwner {name: $filerName})-[:CO_TARGETS*1..4]-(m:BeneficialOwner)\nWHERE ALL(x IN nodes(p) WHERE NOT coalesce(x.is_custodial, false))\nRETURN p\nLIMIT 50","isUpdateQuery":false,"isWriteTransactionChecked":false,"params":[{"name":"$filerName","dataType":"String","suggestions":"none","cypher":null,"suggestionLabel":null,"suggestionProp":null,"suggestionBoolean":false,"collapsed":false}],"hasCypherErrors":false},{"name":"T4 THE GDS VIEW. Boards with the highest betweenness and their immediate interlock neighbourhood - who bridges otherwise-unconnected clusters. Default: 55000 (the p99). The answer is MIXED-CAP: XOS at $0.1B sits alongside IFF at $25.5B. Centrality does not track size. SHARES_DIRECTOR already excludes fund vehicles and non-human directors.","id":"tmpl:1785968038955","createdAt":1785968038955,"text":"Broker boards above $minBetweenness","cypher":"MATCH (c:Company)-[r:SHARES_DIRECTOR]-(o:Company)\nWHERE c.interlock_betweenness >= $minBetweenness\nRETURN c, r, o\nLIMIT 60","isUpdateQuery":false,"isWriteTransactionChecked":false,"params":[{"name":"$minBetweenness","dataType":"Integer","suggestions":"none","cypher":null,"suggestionLabel":null,"suggestionProp":null,"suggestionBoolean":false,"collapsed":false}],"hasCypherErrors":false},{"name":"T5. One Louvain community shown as a community. Default: 0000004904 (AEP, 190 members - big enough to look like a community, small enough to render). For a larger view use 0000001750 (AIR, 747) and raise the limit deliberately. Anchored on the lowest CIK in the cluster because raw interlock_community ids reshuffle between builds. These clusters are STRUCTURAL, not sectoral - measured sector purity is typically 34-52%.","id":"tmpl:1785968038956","createdAt":1785968038956,"text":"Interlock cluster $anchor","cypher":"MATCH (c:Company {interlock_community_anchor: $anchor})-[r:SHARES_DIRECTOR]-(o:Company)\nWHERE o.interlock_community_anchor = $anchor\nRETURN c, r, o\nLIMIT 100","isUpdateQuery":false,"isWriteTransactionChecked":false,"params":[{"name":"$anchor","dataType":"String","suggestions":"none","cypher":null,"suggestionLabel":null,"suggestionProp":null,"suggestionBoolean":false,"collapsed":false}],"hasCypherErrors":false},{"name":"T6. Who holds an issuer, safely. Defaults: MNRO, 500. The holds_count filter is a SAFETY RAIL, not a nicety - HOLDS has 6.7M edges and max out-degree 5,643, so expanding an index giant is fatal to the browser. value_usd is SHARE holdings only; options live in put_notional_usd / call_notional_usd - a market maker once appeared as a $41B utility largest holder while owning 67 shares.","id":"tmpl:1785968038957","createdAt":1785968038957,"text":"Institutional holders of $ticker under $maxHoldings holdings","cypher":"MATCH (m:InstitutionalManager)-[h:HOLDS]->(c:Company {ticker: $ticker})\nWHERE m.holds_count < $maxHoldings\nRETURN m, h, c\nORDER BY h.value_usd DESC\nLIMIT 20","isUpdateQuery":false,"isWriteTransactionChecked":false,"params":[{"name":"$ticker","dataType":"String","suggestions":"none","cypher":null,"suggestionLabel":null,"suggestionProp":null,"suggestionBoolean":false,"collapsed":false},{"name":"$maxHoldings","dataType":"Integer","suggestions":"none","cypher":null,"suggestionLabel":null,"suggestionProp":null,"suggestionBoolean":false,"collapsed":false}],"hasCypherErrors":false}],"sceneActions":[{"name":"Expand board interlocks","id":"a37127c2-16fb-4bc5-9e25-9c45e27bdbe8","createdAt":1785968038958,"cypher":"MATCH (c:Company)-[r:SHARES_DIRECTOR]-(o:Company)\nWHERE elementId(c) IN $nodes\nRETURN c, r, o LIMIT 40","isUpdateQuery":false,"isWriteTransactionChecked":false,"categories":[2],"relationshipTypes":null,"hasCypherErrors":true},{"name":"Show directors","id":"e4967ff1-be56-4a4a-8a93-971d51626c67","createdAt":1785968038959,"cypher":"MATCH (c:Company)<-[r:DIRECTOR_OF]-(i:Insider)\nWHERE elementId(c) IN $nodes\nRETURN c, r, i LIMIT 30","isUpdateQuery":false,"isWriteTransactionChecked":false,"categories":[2],"relationshipTypes":null,"hasCypherErrors":true},{"name":"Show 13D/G filers","id":"c81f2c83-ecd4-4273-aed1-0e253902e9ee","createdAt":1785968038960,"cypher":"MATCH (c:Company)<-[r:BENEFICIAL_OWNER_OF]-(b:BeneficialOwner)\nWHERE elementId(c) IN $nodes\nRETURN c, r, b LIMIT 25","isUpdateQuery":false,"isWriteTransactionChecked":false,"categories":[2],"relationshipTypes":null,"hasCypherErrors":false},{"name":"Show top holders (degree-guarded)","id":"a910bef3-eea7-4d4a-8f9e-207dc4fc2897","createdAt":1785968038961,"cypher":"MATCH (m:InstitutionalManager)-[h:HOLDS]->(c:Company)\nWHERE elementId(c) IN $nodes AND m.holds_count < 500\nRETURN m, h, c ORDER BY h.value_usd DESC LIMIT 20","isUpdateQuery":false,"isWriteTransactionChecked":false,"categories":[2],"relationshipTypes":null,"hasCypherErrors":false},{"name":"This filer's targets","id":"12d32e58-da15-4d57-9d2d-3e4d9189d50f","createdAt":1785968038962,"cypher":"MATCH (b:BeneficialOwner)-[r:BENEFICIAL_OWNER_OF]->(c:Company)\nWHERE elementId(b) IN $nodes\nRETURN b, r, c ORDER BY c.size_usd DESC LIMIT 25","isUpdateQuery":false,"isWriteTransactionChecked":false,"categories":[1],"relationshipTypes":null,"hasCypherErrors":false},{"name":"Co-targeting peers","id":"7c52683c-aaa0-49f6-ae56-448210c873ad","createdAt":1785968038963,"cypher":"MATCH (b:BeneficialOwner)-[r:CO_TARGETS]-(o:BeneficialOwner)\nWHERE elementId(b) IN $nodes AND NOT coalesce(o.is_custodial, false)\nRETURN b, r, o LIMIT 50","isUpdateQuery":false,"isWriteTransactionChecked":false,"categories":[1],"relationshipTypes":null,"hasCypherErrors":false},{"name":"Other boards this person sits on","id":"46feacc9-ca67-4bc8-8f27-05a983aa1223","createdAt":1785968038964,"cypher":"MATCH (i:Insider)-[r:DIRECTOR_OF]->(c:Company)\nWHERE elementId(i) IN $nodes\nRETURN i, r, c LIMIT 25","isUpdateQuery":false,"isWriteTransactionChecked":false,"categories":[3],"relationshipTypes":null,"hasCypherErrors":false}],"hiddenRelationshipTypes":["OFFICER_OF","TEN_PCT_OWNER_OF"],"hideUncategorisedData":true,"type":"STANDARD_PERSPECTIVE","maxLimitToastMsgEnabled":false,"parentPerspectiveId":null,"metadata":{"pathSegments":[{"source":"Insider","relationshipType":"TEN_PCT_OWNER_OF","target":"Company"},{"source":"InstitutionalManager","relationshipType":"HOLDS","target":"Company"},{"source":"BeneficialOwner","relationshipType":"CONTROLS","target":"Company"},{"source":"Insider","relationshipType":"OFFICER_OF","target":"Company"},{"source":"Company","relationshipType":"SHARES_DIRECTOR","target":"Company"},{"source":"BeneficialOwner","relationshipType":"INFLUENCES","target":"Company"},{"source":"BeneficialOwner","relationshipType":"BENEFICIAL_OWNER_OF","target":"Company"},{"source":"_Bloom_Perspective_","relationshipType":"_Bloom_HAS_SCENE_","target":"_Bloom_Scene_"},{"source":"BeneficialOwner","relationshipType":"CO_TARGETS","target":"BeneficialOwner"},{"source":"Insider","relationshipType":"DIRECTOR_OF","target":"Company"},{"source":"Company","relationshipType":"SAME_ENTITY_AS","target":"BeneficialOwner"}],"indexes":[{"label":"BeneficialOwner","type":"native","propertyKeys":[{"key":"name","metadataProp":false},{"key":"owner_key","metadataProp":false}]},{"label":"Company","type":"native","propertyKeys":[{"key":"cik","metadataProp":false},{"key":"sector","metadataProp":false},{"key":"sic_code","metadataProp":false},{"key":"ticker","metadataProp":false}]},{"label":null,"type":"native","propertyKeys":[]},{"label":"Insider","type":"native","propertyKeys":[{"key":"name","metadataProp":false},{"key":"cik","metadataProp":false}]},{"label":"InstitutionalManager","type":"native","propertyKeys":[{"key":"name","metadataProp":false},{"key":"cik","metadataProp":false}]},{"type":"full-text","state":"ONLINE","entityType":"NODE","tokenNames":["Company","Insider","InstitutionalManager","BeneficialOwner"],"name":"entity_name_fulltext","propertyNames":["name"],"provider":{"key":"fulltext","version":"2.0"}}]},"version":"2.21.0","sha":"Emyoap4F3dMgYi0qqT1bVHtUGoBxY56Tzr+9xvyraak="}